---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import Button from './Button.astro';
import HomePageLink from './HomePageLink.astro';
import headshot from '../assets/headshot.jpg';
---

<section
	class="mb-10 grid gap-6 md:mb-20 md:grid-cols-[1.2fr_0.8fr] md:items-center md:gap-10 lg:gap-12"
>
	<div class="hero-fade-up">
		<div class="mb-4 flex items-start gap-4">
			<Image
				src={headshot}
				alt=""
				class="h-20 w-20 shrink-0 rounded-lg border border-blue/50 object-cover object-[center_30%] md:hidden"
				width={2048}
				height={3072}
				loading="eager"
				aria-hidden="true"
			/>
			<div class="min-w-0">
				<h1 class="hero-fade-up hero-fade-up-delay-1 mb-2 md:mb-4">Hi, I'm Becca.</h1>
				<p
					class="hero-fade-up hero-fade-up-delay-2 editorial-prose font-sans text-lg font-medium leading-relaxed text-text md:mb-4 md:text-xl"
				>
					I speak and write about technology, community, and systems.
				</p>
			</div>
		</div>
		<p
			class="hero-fade-up hero-fade-up-delay-3 editorial-prose mb-6 leading-[1.8] text-text-muted"
		>
			Over the last decade I've built developer tools, design systems, data visualization platforms,
			and other software that people rely on every day. Along the way I've led teams, mentored engineers,
			spoken at conferences, and learned that the hardest problems are rarely purely technical.
		</p>
		<p class="hero-fade-up hero-fade-up-delay-3 editorial-prose mb-6 leading-[1.8] text-text-muted">
			These days I'm increasingly interested in what happens after we build things: how technical
			systems shape institutions, how AI affects communities, and what makes people and organizations
			resilient when circumstances change.
		</p>
		<div class="hero-fade-up hero-fade-up-delay-4 flex flex-col items-start gap-4">
			<Button href="/writing">Read my essays</Button>
			<div class="flex flex-col items-start gap-2">
				<HomePageLink href="/speaking-and-writing">Speaking & Technical Writing</HomePageLink>
				<HomePageLink href="/making-things">Browse projects</HomePageLink>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>

	<div
		class="hero-fade-up hero-fade-up-delay-3 relative hidden w-80 justify-self-end md:block lg:w-96"
	>
		<Image
			src={headshot}
			alt="Headshot of Becca Bailey"
			class="h-auto w-full rounded-lg border border-blue/50"
			width={2048}
			height={3072}
			loading="eager"
		/>
	</div>
</section>
